# Pre-homelab notes. Since 14 Sep 2026 homelab's sops places all of these
# (modules/platform/secrets.nix) on the host that runs observability --
# arcade-box since 26 Sep 2026 -- so nothing here is copied by hand; the
# "created automatically" below is sops too. Kept for where the UniFi and
# Discord values come from. Paths homelab's modules/observability reads:
#
#   /var/lib/monitoring/secrets/unpoller.pass      # one line, UniFi local user "unpoller" password
#   /var/lib/monitoring/secrets/discord-webhook    # one line, Discord webhook URL
#   /var/lib/monitoring/secrets/grafana-admin      # created automatically on first switch
#
# UniFi: Settings → Admins → Create local-only user named exactly `unpoller`.
# View-only / Limited Admin is enough. Do not reuse the port-forward admin if you can avoid it.
#
# Discord: pick an ops channel (not #server-status) → Edit channel → Integrations →
# Webhooks → New Webhook → Copy webhook URL.
